		{
			title: "Glitched Out"
			icon: "tfb2:glitched_ingot"
			x: -4.0d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Not Quite Right"
			description: [
				"&dYes yes, there we go! Okay, when you complete a Vault Objective, and you've fulfilled a condition on one of those cards, you should get some extra items in that Completion Crate."
				""
				"&5Oh I see. Hiding the contraband in their own reward system. Not bad, sis."
				""
				"&dThats only step one, brother. Step two is... a bit of luck. See, those hacked Cards? They'll pull resources from the deepest parts of their storage. The stuff on old servers, old versions, that isn't quite right. And with any luck..."
				""
				"&5...Bandit will get some junk back?"
				""
				"&dNot just any junk. Glitched junk. Glitchy, broken items. We can use these, so send us, say, 5 of them? To start with at least. And 5 of those Glitched Blocks as well. We'll need a lot of them if this works..."
			]
