		{
			title: "Vault Death, Level 20, And You"
			icon: "minecraft:skeleton_skull"
			x: 6.191964285714285d
			y: -1.2232142857142918d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "A Difficulty Tweak"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, when you hit 20, you should wait before going into another Vault!"
				""
				"&5Aye, things get a bit more difficult for ye now...see, now when ye die in a Vault, ye'll lose most of the equipment yer carrying."
				""
				"&dNot permanently(usually...). Your Coin Pouch should stay with you at least, and any Soulbound equipment. Either at your Bed or your World Spawn should be your Ghost Body."
				""
				"&5To get yer equipment back, ye'll need to Right Click and pick this body up, and bring it to a Spirit Extractor. Then Right Click the body onto it."
				""
				"&dThe Spirit Extractor will list how much Vault Gold it costs to get your equipment back. If you don't have enough, you may have the option to get your items back in exchange for going into debt with The Locker. See the Spirit Extractor quest in the next section."
			]
			dependencies: ["3011291910FDA2DC"]
