		}
		{
			title: "A Tool for All Occasions"
			x: -8.25d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "There are many like it..."
			description: [
				"&dTo try encouraging Users to make and send in all sorts of normal tools, the FOP encourages you to use the special Vault Tools you can make in the Tool Station."
				""
				"&5Vault Tools have a good amount of durabiility, even at the lower tiers. As you increase your Vault Level, you can make bigger and bigger tools."
				""
				"&dYou can only repair them a set number of times, though. But early on you'll be upgrading your tools regularly anyways."
				""
				"&5They can't really be used as weapons like some other tools can, though...At least not effectively."
				""
				"&dVersatility makes up for that, brother. You can augment and upgrade your tools with Jewels, which will need its own quests to explain~."
			]
			dependencies: ["232779928B96328E"]
			id: "3E4FCFC9637F8B61"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2863933608E700CF"
				type: "observation"
				title: "Observe a Tool Station"
