		{
			title: "In The Soul Market"
			x: -4.0d
			y: -3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Spend Wisely"
			description: [
				"&dThe Black Market is a way for you to obtain items and materials that can help you in the Vaults. The cost? Soul Shards, which it can pull directly from your Soul Pouch."
				""
				"&5It sells equipment, resources, and other such things. But only three items at a time..."
				""
				"&d...well, and a Random Item option at a fixed price."
				""
				"&5The items vary in price, but the middle slot is highlighted in purple, and considered a Good Deal almost always."
				""
				"&dThere's also some items that will ONLY show up in this special slot, so keep an eye on it!"
				""
				"&5There's also a special item called Soul Ichor, which will let ye 'reroll' the shop on the spot, instead of waiting out the timer."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["287AFB08CA4CC848"]
