		{
			title: "Crystal Customization"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Have It Your Way"
			description: [
				"&dSo while this might be quite expensive to start with, Bandit, you'll want to get one of these up and running."
				""
				"&5Called a Crystal Workbench. The Black Chromatic Steel is expensive, but Pillaging those Braziers can net ya an early one."
				""
				"&dYou'll need it to Modify those Vault Crystals you make. You can't modify much in the early level, but..."
				""
				"&5That Seal you got from us is one way to modify yer crystals. That'll lock in what objective the Vault has."
				""
				"&dGood for both of us since I think we'll need to use the specific objectives to crack the system more. But yeah, your crystals at low level can't be modified too much. That's Capacity, which goes up as you level."
				""
				"&5There's a bunch of different things ye can do to a Crystal. Capstones, Themes, etc. Real interesting."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["76B7D44E338DC9B7"]
