		{
			title: "Quite Magnetizing"
			x: -14.0d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "An Attractive Personality"
			description: [
				"&dOne piece of Vault Gear you might not have yet is the Magnet."
				""
				"&5Quite a useful piece of gear for looting, especially. Any items dropped nearby fly right to you to pick up."
				""
				"&dYou can make one in the Vault Forge if you haven't gotten one from looting yet, Bandit. They can have some useful abilities on them."
				""
				"&5Magnets have a mode that can be toggled with a hotkey. By default, ye start in Pickup Only mode, Bandit, which picks up all items near ye."
				""
				"&dThe second mode is Pickup + Void. This will pick up all items around you, but delete anything blocks that are registered as part of the Vault's design, like dirt or bricks."
				""
				"&5The last mode is Off, which disables your Magnet completely."
			]
