				"&dVault Potions (vials, mixes, brews, etc) can be further augmented by using the Alchemy Table."
				""
				"&5You can slap on an extra ability onto the Potion that activates when it is consumed. Such as replenshing Mana as well as your Hitpoints."
				""
				"&dMany of the really good potion abilities can only be found inside Vaults. But those won't be available to find until at least level 20."
