		{
			title: "Welcome to Vault Burger"
			x: -9.75d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Home of the Vault Burger"
			description: [
				"&dLiving Chests regularly contain the ingredients for Vault Burgers."
				""
				"&5Vault Burgers don't really feed your hunger or anything. Instead, they give you some Vault Experience."
				""
				"&dThey are a good way to speed up leveling. The higher level you are, the more Burger ingredients you'll find, to make bigger Burgers."
				""
				"&5Though be careful, Bandit. It's highly suggested you just.... save up all the ingredients you find."
				""
				"&dAt least until around level 50, when the XP curve of leveling goes up sharply."
