		{
			title: "Difficulties and Death"
			x: 6.629464285714285d
			y: -1.6607142857142918d
			shape: "gear"
			description: [
				"&dSo Bandit, dieing in a Vault in the FOPGame Server is handled differently depending on what Vault Mode the server/world is set on."
				""
				"&5By default, the server is set to Normal. If you set it to Casual, you keep yer inventory, but yer equipment will take a durability hit."
				""
				"&dAnd if you are in Hardcore, there is no body, and no way to get your equipment back (outside of Server Commands)"
				""
				"[[If you had a bug or error or other, see the Administrative section of the Quest Book to learn the inventory retrieval commands, or how to change your world's Vault Mode]]"
			]
