			title: "Still Alive"
			x: -1.5d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Blazing Return"
			description: [
				"&dThat Phoenix Capstone we gave you is an example of one of the things you can add onto a vault crystal."
				""
				"&5You can only add one kind of Capstone per crystal, but they tend to be pretty powerful. Like the Phoenix Capstone, which will resurrect you on the spot if you die inside the Vault."
				""
				"&dGives you another chance but can be bad if you died cause you got trapped by a thousand horde mobs."
				""
				"&5Can only swing yer weapons so fast, ya know?"
