		{
			title: "Sparkling Jewels"
			x: -9.0d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Adorned with Power"
			description: [
				"&dSo we mentioned Jewels you can find in the the Vaults, or more specifically : Jewel Pouches"
				""
				"&5Ye find them in Gilded Chests usually, and holding and Right Clicking them will give ye a choice between three different Jewels."
				""
				"&dSometimes the Jewels have more than one ability on them, but all of the Jewels from Pouches will be Size 10."
				""
				"&5If ye look at yer Vault Tools, Bandit, they have a Capacity. Ye put Jewels on with this Jewel Applicator by putting the Tool and all the Jewels in."
				""
				"&dYou can see the final stats of the tool before properly applying them."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
