			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, this will seem quite expensive to you early on to build, I think it'll be quite useful at some point."
				""
				"&5This Augment Station will let ye craft any Themes you have unlocked."
				""
				"&dYou can get Augment Pieces by recycling unused Augments."
