		{
			title: "Gear Information"
			x: -9.75d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "What Is Up With It?"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, quick primer for you on Vault Gear and their stats."
				""
				"&5So all Vault Gear stats are split into three catagories of Affixes : Implicits, Prefixes, and Suffixes. Each Gear piece has a set number of each of these, usually depending on rarity."
				""
				"&dImplicits are the base stats of a piece. Armor always has Armor, Weapons always have Damage in their list of implicits. Some Implicit slots can be a number of things, like Block OR Thorns on shields, but usually never both at the same time... at least as an Implicit."
				""
				"&5Prefixes and Suffixes are the various bonus stats a piece of gear has, and are much easier to reroll than Implicits are. They can be anything from extra armor or damage, more mana, better looting, or even special abilities like causing a Poison or Frost nova to happen when you hit an enemy."
				""
				"&dOh, Bandit! If a gear piece adds to a listed ability, you need at LEAST one point in that ability to use it! "
			]
			dependencies: ["5E574242513BE343"]
			id: "739D201BBF702013"
			tasks: [{
				id: "66DE3B2D8804617F"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Unique Field Guide"
			x: 1.75d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Kind of Like VHat Can I Roll?"
			description: [
				"&dIt looks like the FOP added an item in to help players hunt down their special 'unique' items they added to the game."
				""
				"&5Aye, they hoped to incentivise looting and vaulting to find these rare Unique pieces of gear, but it turns out if ye got no idea where to find em..."
				""
				"&d...then Players won't bother with the chase, yeah. So they came out with the Unique Codex."
				""
				"&5It works kind of like the VHat Can I Roll tool we added to yer Vault Window (Key: H). Both are nice to have, yeah."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["76B7D44E338DC9B7"]
			id: "7C06CB39886FCC9B"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0E41BFBAFDE67D5D"
