		{
			title: "Clearing Conflicts"
			icon: "the_vault:demagnetizer"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 2.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Computer, Deactivate Lizard"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, as you start to get higher level and get more gear and tools, you'll probably end up with a need to...turn off some of those tools in your Base."
				""
				"&5Aye, popping half yer base with a super hammer isn't really fun the first time."
				""
				"&dNor is always having to dig into your backpack to grab dropped items."
				""
				"&5So there's a few things ye can make to help out. The Bag Suppressor will stop your Sophisticated Backpacks from auto picking up items in an area."
				""
				"&dAnd the Magnet Suppressor will disable all Vault Magnets near it."
				""
				"&5As for the hammer, ye can use the Hammer Suppressor to disable the area effect of yer hammer. Save yerself a big headache."
				""
				"&dAnd to save an even bigger headache if you got pets or villagers, the Ability Suppressor turns most of your deadly, damaging abilities off too."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
