		{
			title: "Adapt Or Perish"
			x: -5.5d
			y: -3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "A Worthy Sacrifice"
			description: [
				"&5The Adaptive Focus is a rare Focus you can only obtain by recycling Omega rarity gear. There's a 1 in 4 chance of getting an Adaptive Focus when you scrap one, but can be very powerful."
				""
				"&5When you apply an Adaptive Focus to a piece of gear in the Artisan Station, it will upgrade the tier of EVERY modifier on it."
				""
				"&5The downside is twofold, though : It is very expensive to apply, and it will consume a Repair Slot on the piece of gear."
