			description: [
				"&5If ye are playing on a server and an Assistant joining yer game late, ye can use the Mentor's Brew to bring them up to yer level."
				""
				"&dWhen you craft the Mentor's Brew, it will be set to the level you are at the time. When someone else drinks it, their level will raise up to match yours."
