		{
			title: "Additional Pylons"
			icon: "the_vault:pylon"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Construct? No, Break Them!"
			description: [
				"&5Dotted around the Vaults you can occasionally find these large floating crystals called Pylons."
				""
				"&5Each Pylon will give you a specific buff for a short amount of time, which will be listed above the Pylon if you are close enough."
				""
				"&5You can Right Click the Pylon to activate it.."
				""
				"&5...Or you can break the Pylon!"
				""
				"&5Breaking it gives you a small chance at obtaining a Temporal Shard. These roll like other Vault Gear, and can have a powerful ability."
				""
				"&5The Temporal Shard is consumed when used, but you can hold and save Shards between Vaults."
			]
