		{
			title: "A Warm Drink"
			icon: "the_vault:cafe_vienne"
			x: -9.75d
			y: 2.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "...And Not Much Else"
			description: [
				"&5Ah, a warm drink is especially good on a cold day, especially if ye get one with some caffeine in it."
				""
				"&dThe FOP have just added something for that, it looks like. Make yourself a Vault Drink Machine, and an Empty Glass to hold the drink, of course."
				""
				"&5Hm, so ye just set down the Drink Machine, and use an Empty Glass on it to get a warm drink?"
				""
				"&dYep, and all of them will give you a bit of a Speed boost for a couple minutes."
				""
				"&5A Speed boost? Now that'd be handy for Bandit in the Vaults."
				""
				"&dSorry, bro, looks like you can't drink these inside a Vault. And they only last half a minute to boot."
				""
				"&5But, why then? Whats the bloody point?"
				""
				"&dThe Machine does look cool at least."
