				tag: { }
			}
			x: -8.25d
			y: 1.3125d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Removing the Cruft"
			description: [
				"&5As you collect Jewels, you'll find rarer ones that have multiple attributes on them. And sometimes, one of those attributes you just don't want, while everything else is great."
				""
				"&5The extra attribute could ruin an otherwise perfect tool. Having a Wooden Chestbreaker that slices through stone like butter creates more problems, for example."
				""
				"&5To fix this, you can craft and apply a Chiseling Focus. There are many different Chiseling Focus, and each one removes a specific tool attribute."
			]
