		{
			title: "Hit A Little Too Hard"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "PLAYER SMASH!"
			description: [
				"&5Hm, one thing I remember is how frustrating it can be to try getting enough Vault Gems. Especially specific ones since there's over a dozen of em. Anything ye can do about that, sis?"
				""
				"&dI was remembering the same, bro. How about I add these: Smashed Vault Gems! They can be used to increase the amount of another Vault Gem you are low on."
				""
				"&5Like duplicating em?"
				""
				"&dYep, so you gotta have one of the gem in the first place, then you can convert one Vault Gem into another one. But only the Player, or rather, Bird Gems. I couldn't get it working for Echo Gems."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["69C663CDD23190A9"]
			id: "1FA20B877600934C"
			tasks: [{
