		{
			title: "Missing Ingredients"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 2.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Got a Substitute?"
			description: [
				"&dSometimes the Vault Altar asks for some... difficult items to make a Crystal. Maybe you are in a Skyvault and don't have that mob egg yet. Maybe the nearest jungle is 10k blocks away."
				""
				"&5Whatever the case is, ye can reroll the current Vault Crystal cost by using an Altar Recatalyzer."
				""
				"&dBy Sneak + Right Clicking the Altar Recatalyzer on your Altar, it will reroll the items it asks for."
				""
				"&5Note that ye don't get a refund if you already put stuff in!"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
