					"patchouli:book": "patchouli:vault_lexicon"
				}
			}
			x: 4.25d
			y: -3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "The Affix Atlas, The Modifier Manual"
			description: [
				"&5As you start rolling and gathering Vault Gear, you'll start coming across more interesting Affixes that may not be obvious what they do. Ones like Heart Frag Chance, or Echoing, are not self explanatory after all!"
				""
				"&5To that, you can get yourself a Vault Lexicon! It contains entries on most affixes available on Vault Gear, and a description of what they do."
			]
